<title>USA: El Paso Cty SD 3, Colo., yields 5.70 pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>El Paso Cty SD 3, Colo., yields 5.70 pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanifen, Imhoff Inc said it tentatively priced $ 7.900 million of El Paso County School District No 3 (Widefield), Colo., with a top yield of 5.70 percent.</p>
